<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-Kalbe Farma H1 net up slightly.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Kalbe Farma H1 net up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>				  (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				40.62   vs   38.01</p>
<p>    Net sales				263.16   vs  244.96</p>
<p>    Gross profit			   136.54   vs  121.63</p>
<p>    Operating profit			59.00   vs   55.36</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  65.84   vs   63.09</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		    231.51   vs  155.12</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)	 94	vs    176</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were unaudited. The EPS for first half 1997 was adjusted following a stock split. PT Kalbe Farma is a pharmaceutical firm.</p>
<p>--- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
